{
  "label": "futabafirstvisit",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label futabafirstvisit:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock on Futaba's door and wait for her to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I figure with the amount of time I've spent at the library lately (As well as her not-so-hidden affinity for me), getting into her room shouldn't be all that hard.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But hey, she's a teenage girl and...girls can be territorial when it comes to their rooms or something. Probably.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don't really know. Ami isn't like that at all, but Ami is also proving to be a...special sort of case thus far.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...hello?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Futaba, are you in there right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei? I'm sorry, I had no idea you were coming. Is something wrong?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope. Just dropping by to see how you’re doing. Mind coming out for a second?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course! I'll be right out!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a step back and wait for Futaba to- oh. Nevermind. She's already here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux1.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...hi. Is there...something I can do for you?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, actually. Can I borrow 1000 yen?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...suppose. But can I...ask why you need to borrow money from me?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Futaba, no. Don't just agree to lending me money like that. I was only messing around.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux2.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": H-How was I supposed to know that? You've never visited me in my room before. I thought this might be some sort of emergency.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The only emergency here is my boredom.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway, what are you up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux3.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just reading...like always.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're lucky you knocked at a good stopping point. Otherwise, I probably wouldn't have even answered...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You did sound a little confused answering the door. Do you not normally get visitors or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux4.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not ones that knock, at least...Most people just walk in.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I'll make sure to follow proper protocol next time and just open the door without running it by you first.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please don't ever do that at any point ever. I would die.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm more than happy to invite you in so long as I...actually know you're coming and-",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cool. Let me in, then.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux2.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right now? Are you serious?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. It's my duty as your teacher to make sure your...dorm room is conducive to proper...educational...learning stuff?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does that sound like something a teacher would say?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That doesn't sound like something anyone would say...why are you acting so strangely all of a sudden?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is wanting to be alone with you inside of your room really that strange?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux5.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...maybe strange was the wrong word to use. It's just...entirely unexpected.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I guess if it's just to...make sure my room is conducive to proper...educational...learning stuff...it's okay?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There's not really...much to show you, though...so I doubt you'll have any fun.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just being with you is fun enough for me, Futaba.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux6.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Umm...this might be a bit of a silly question, but...this isn't some sort of prank, is it?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did...someone put you up to this? Or...is there some sort of catch I don't know about yet?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. Why would you even assume that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's just that...this all seems a little too good to be true. That's all.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux7.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": W-W-W-W-Which doesn't mean that I've actually ever thought about something like this happening, of course!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just mean that in a...hypothetical situation where...I had been dreaming about something like that...then this would be too good to be true.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But as it stands, it's just...it's just normal good.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Futaba.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux8.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, I'm sorry. Please follow me in, Sensei...but again, don't expect too much...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux9.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, umm, here we are...my completely unexciting bedroom...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm going to go ahead and assume this the first time you’ve had a guy in your room?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux10.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The only other guy I know is my dad, so...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There's no way that is the only other male you know.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux11.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Boys, umm...weren't really interested in me in middle school...so I mostly just...flew under the radar.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Way under the radar.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And while I like attending an all-girls school for...completely unrelated reasons...it hasn’t really helped prepare me for situations like this...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No secret online boyfriends or anything either?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux12.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not that I'm aware of...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There was one...umm...person on a message board I used to visit, but...that was a...kind of...roleplaying thing, so...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux13.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": W-Why am I even telling you about that when you...obviously don't want to hear any of it.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re just...here to look at the room...right, Sensei? For the...learning...education thing?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You probably don't even know what roleplay is and...uhh...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux14.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you please say something to prevent me from rambling and revealing any more embarrassing secrets?",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess, but I was kind of interested in hearing where that was going.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't even know...how I would have started in explaining it, so...it's probably best if we just move on and forget any of the last two minutes ever happened.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I scan Futaba’s side of the room and I'm not able to really learn anything new about her other than that she's a bit neater and more organized than Rin.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There’s a quote from Edgar Allan Poe on her dry erase board, which is...sort of surprising since she doesn't seem like the type to indulge in gothic poetry...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I guess I don't really seem like that type of person either and I don't have any problems with him.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Dying alone, drunk, and probably rabid is a pretty memorable way to go out, all things considered.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux12.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, umm...this is where I do all of my school work and...all of my writing.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When I'm...actually able to get any writing done, that is. Being creative is...kind of really hard and I wish I was better at it.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, have you started writing anything for me yet? Because practicing is pretty much the only way you're going to get any better.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux10.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have, but....it’s not very good.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I see it? Or are you going to make me wait until it's more up to your standards?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux15.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-Ignoring how low my standards are...please wait a little longer!",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I've...barely even started! I need more time to...build the world and...the characters and...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The plot...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How much have you gotten done, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux16.webp",
      "alt": "futabafirstdormredux16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The title?...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Being creative is...really hard...",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, I told you before right? I’ll help you with whatever you need help with.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know, I know...It’s just really embarrassing.",
      "spk": "Futaba",
      "spkColor": "#E73CFF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene futabafirstdormredux15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/futabafirstdormredux15.webp",
